{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想在 Apple Watch 上抬手即出示會員條碼，或需要在 iPhone 上快速讀寫 NFC 標籤，這款工具都能勝任。《Tag Shark》原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，同時支援 iPhone 與 Apple Watch。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-162.webp\">\n<h2>條碼掃描與感應標籤讀寫</h2>\n<p>「Tag Shark」集條碼掃描、儲存與感應標籤讀寫於一身，適合常出示會員條碼或要處理感應標籤的用家。支援 QR、Code 128、Aztec、Data Matrix、PDF417 等格式，可無限儲存條碼並自訂標籤，亦可從剪貼板貼上條碼圖像或手動輸入。名片掃描後即時轉成 QR 碼，感應標籤資料也可轉為條碼或 QR 碼，並寫入連結、通話及短訊。已選條碼會同步到 Apple Watch，抬手即可出示。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-180-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-181-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-182-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-183-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-184-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-185-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Tag Shark: Barcode &amp; NFC</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T11:39:59.031903+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":389,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T11:36:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T04:37:39.114538+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T11:37:38.804819+00:00","content_hash":"ca8da7a82e7bacd261d2306a7f95616d910beaaec64a7791e33d2ddb1ec3ed08","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}